# Any Code.gs is assumed to be somebody's working copy with real values in
# it — a developer token, a Gemini key — and this repository is public.
Code.gs

# The one exception is the loader, which is secret-free by construction:
# every value it exposes is read from Script Properties, and t/loader.js
# fails the moment a literal appears in it. It is versioned because on
# 24 Oct 2026 it was overwritten in Apps Script with no copy anywhere.
!apps-script/Code.gs
